[h1]Languages (语言)[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/voxygen/README/README.html]EN/English[/url]|[url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/voxygen/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Voxygen[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that generates vanilla terrain locally and submits it to [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/voxy]Voxy[/url]. It fills distant Voxy terrain without asking the server to load or generate every source chunk.
[quote]
[!IMPORTANT]
Multiplayer generation requires the exact world seed. A wrong seed produces terrain that does not match the server. Due to [url=https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC/issues/MC-55596]MC-55596[/url], generated features such as trees may be inconsistent with the server even when the seed is correct.
[/quote]
[h2]Commands[/h2][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Command[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen on[/b][/td]
[td]Enable Voxygen.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen off[/b][/td]
[td]Disable Voxygen and stop the active session.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Toggle Voxygen.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen status[/b][/td]
[td]Show the world, seed, radius, progress, thread usage, and result counters.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen radius[/b][/td]
[td]Show the configured radius in vanilla chunks.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen radius <radius>[/b][/td]
[td]Set the radius. Default: [b]64[/b]; minimum: [b]1[/b].[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen threads[/b][/td]
[td]Show the worker-thread count.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen threads <threads>[/b][/td]
[td]Set worker threads from [b]1[/b] to [b]256[/b]. Default: [b]32[/b].[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen progress[/b][/td]
[td]Show whether the progress boss bar is enabled.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen progress on|off|toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Control the progress boss bar. It is disabled by default.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen generateforfreecam[/b][/td]
[td]Show whether Freecam-priority generation is enabled.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen generateforfreecam on|off|toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Prioritize the 3×3 large-region area around the current camera. It is disabled by default.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen seed[/b][/td]
[td]Show the effective seed for the current world.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/voxygen seed <seed>[/b][/td]
[td]Set the multiplayer seed. Hidden when the integrated server provides it.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Performance notes[/h2][list]
[*]Chunk generation is CPU- and memory-intensive. Increase [b]threads[/b] gradually rather than immediately using every available logical processor.[/*]
[*]A larger radius increases the number of large regions quadratically.[/*]
[/list][h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.3[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.5+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.160.5+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Voxy (Required)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
